<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικατα-βάλλω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικάββαλον, τῷ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ᾽ ἐπὶ φᾶρος κάββαλε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.187
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				14.583
			</span></i>:—<i>cast over</i>, Il.cc.; <i>throw down
			upon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸν οἶκόν τισι</span>,
			of Samson, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				5.8.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.15.5
			</span></i>; <i>throw down at</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					50.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>let fall
				down</i> or <i>droop</i>
			<i>at</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					4.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>impose a
				fine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Tab.Heracl.
				1.134
			</span></i>, where for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαταβάνοντι</span>
			Ahrens corrected -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλίοντι</span>
				(fut.part.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be distrained upon</i> by a creditor, Meyer
				<i>Juristische Papyri</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				p.224
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
</div>